   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2013-03-06",
   "text": "Defund Obamacare Act - Deauthorizes appropriations to carry out the Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act or the Health Care and Education Reconciliation Act of 2010, or any amendments made by them.\n Rescinds the unobligated balance of funds made available under such Acts."
  }
